    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22304" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incentĭo</span></b> , ōnis,
			f.
		incino. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A blowing</i> or <i>playing</i> upon
			an instrument (postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incentiones tibiarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					4, 13, 3</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A charm</i>, <i>enchantment;
			plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Gell. 16, 11, 2</span></i>.</div>
